Package: ntpsec-rs-core
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: NTPsec core library — deterministic time synchronization engine
 Forensic Rust reconstruction of the NTPsec time-discipline brain.

Package: ntpsec-rs-d
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, ntpsec-rs-core (= ${binary:Version})
Description: NTPsec daemon — high-precision time synchronization daemon
 Drop-in replacement for NTPsec ntpd. Synchronizes system time with NTP servers,
 supports NTS, Mode 6 control protocol, and broad configuration compatibility.

Package: ntpsec-rs-query
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, ntpsec-rs-core (= ${binary:Version})
Description: NTP query tool — ntpq replacement
 Provides ntpq-compatible Mode 6 query interface.

Package: ntpsec-rs-dig
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, ntpsec-rs-core (= ${binary:Version})
Description: NTP query tool — ntpdig replacement
 Provides ntpdig-compatible NTP query interface.
